WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.950
The Strait of Hormuz.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.510
In 2025, 20 million barrels a day of
crude oil and oil products passed through

3
00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:08.250
it.

4
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:14.190
The International Energy Agency reports
that conflict from 28 February 2026 impeded

5
00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:15.510
those flows.

6
00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:21.090
In March, April and May, they averaged
about 2.7 million barrels a day.

7
00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:25.250
Far from the Gulf, farmers and
food importers felt the shock.

8
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:26.750
