10
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:33.310
In this mission, you'll define
food, water and energy security,

11
00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.870
and how the three depend on one another.

12
00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:38.630
Then you'll test the emergency responses:

13
00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:42.930
bypass pipelines and 400
million barrels of oil stocks.

14
00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:47.850
Your mission: explain why farmers and
food importers far from the Gulf felt the

15
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:48.510
